{"id":"contraire","lemma":"contraire","pos":"adj","rank":954,"glosses":["opposite","contradictory","hostile, unfavourable"],"ipa":"/kɔ̃.tʁɛːʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d2/Fr-contraire.ogg/Fr-contraire.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"contraires"},"formAudio":{"contraires":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/92/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-contraires.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le contraire est aussi vrai.","en":"The opposite is also true.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"too, also, as well"},{"g":"true"}]},{"text":"Il a fait le contraire.","en":"He did the opposite.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Je voulais dire le contraire.","en":"I meant the opposite.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to say, to tell"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"C'est contraire à la loi.","en":"It's against the law.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,null,{"g":"law"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"a la"]]},{"text":"Personne ne peut dire le contraire.","en":"No one can deny that.","words":[{"g":"no one, nobody"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to say, to tell"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}